        "chapterId": 13,
        "headingId": 434,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>2F0Z &amp; XH09B0 Benign neoplasms of respiratory and intrathoracic organs, unspecified &amp; Papillary adenoma, NOS</p>\r\n",
